{“Background”: (“Cammy White is an agent of the Delta Red commando task force, operating within Britain's Secret Intelligent Service (M16). Enchanced by M. Bison's genome, she once worked as an assassin for Shadaloo under the name "Killer Bee." However, she was able to rebel against Bison, losing her memories and she was taken to Britain; it is there that she joined the special forces unit known as Delta Red. Now, she spends her time pursuing missions in her home country of England.

